{
 "duration": 41.874,
 "frames": 1256,
 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "A soldier is chasing emus in a truck with a machine gun on the back.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 3.92,
   "line": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "The emus are winning.",
   "start": 4.276,
   "end": 5.683,
   "line": 0
  },
  {
   "text": "Western Australia,",
   "start": 6.1,
   "end": 7.125,
   "line": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "nineteen thirty-two.",
   "start": 7.346,
   "end": 8.447,
   "line": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "Twenty thousand emus are wrecking the wheat farms,",
   "start": 8.899,
   "end": 11.937,
   "line": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "so the farmers,",
   "start": 12.151,
   "end": 13.14,
   "line": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "many of them ex-soldiers,",
   "start": 13.14,
   "end": 14.479,
   "line": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "ask for machine guns.",
   "start": 14.706,
   "end": 16.075,
   "line": 1
  },
  {
   "text": "The army sends a major,",
   "start": 16.379,
   "end": 17.646,
   "line": 2
  },
  {
   "text": "two guns,",
   "start": 17.907,
   "end": 18.38,
   "line": 2
  },
  {
   "text": "and ten thousand bullets.",
   "start": 18.38,
   "end": 20.3,
   "line": 2
  },
  {
   "text": "The plan:",
   "start": 20.624,
   "end": 21.105,
   "line": 2
  },
  {
   "text": "herd the emus toward the guns.",
   "start": 21.404,
   "end": 23.264,
   "line": 2
  },
  {
   "text": "They scatter instead.",
   "start": 23.55,
   "end": 24.786,
   "line": 2
  },
  {
   "text": "One gun jams.",
   "start": 25.113,
   "end": 26.223,
   "line": 2
  },
  {
   "text": "And the truck?",
   "start": 26.457,
   "end": 27.008,
   "line": 2
  },
  {
   "text": "Too bumpy to aim.",
   "start": 27.286,
   "end": 28.443,
   "line": 2
  },
  {
   "text": "The army pulls out,",
   "start": 28.783,
   "end": 29.833,
   "line": 3
  },
  {
   "text": "gets sent back in,",
   "start": 30.1,
   "end": 31.097,
   "line": 3
  },
  {
   "text": "and shoots for weeks.",
   "start": 31.274,
   "end": 32.719,
   "line": 3
  },
  {
   "text": "The major's own tally?",
   "start": 32.984,
   "end": 34.065,
   "line": 4
  },
  {
   "text": "About ten bullets per emu.",
   "start": 34.349,
   "end": 36.053,
   "line": 4
  },
  {
   "text": "When farmers asked for the army again,",
   "start": 36.501,
   "end": 38.416,
   "line": 4
  },
  {
   "text": "the answer was no.",
   "start": 38.638,
   "end": 39.932,
   "line": 4
  },
  {
   "text": "The emus had won.",
   "start": 40.257,
   "end": 41.663,
   "line": 4
  }
 ]
}